      "text": "石头剪刀布相克被扩展为可连招的第一人称决斗",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Combat is built around immediate, clear choices: pick a Sign, punish the right target, and capitalize on mistakes. Bait and counter - it’s Rock, Paper, Scissors elevated into tense, combo-driven duels.",
