      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "重招会让手指抽筋，短期爆发会压缩后续选择",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Big moves hurt your fingers. Every heavy play increases cramps and reduces options until you recover, forcing decisions: spend big for a win now, or pace yourself for survival.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2423290/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "腐化作为无法被克制的第四元素，以高代价换取巨额增益",
